        "line_ref": "第1004行"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingFuJu_L004",
      "original_quote": "蔭印拱⾝⾝臨⽥宅梁相拱沖是也,勿坐空亡｡",
